      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for mcphost fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-5160: github.com/yuin/goldmark/renderer: Cross-site Scripting due to improper URL validation (bsc#1272488).\n- CVE-2026-39821: golang.org/x/net/idna: failure to reject ASCII-only Punycode-encoded labels allows for validation\n  bypass and privilege escalation (bsc#1266572).\n- CVE-2026-56852: golang.org/x/text/unicode/norm: infinite loop on truncated/invalid UTF-8 input (bsc#1272131).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
